# Toast — a toast manager: each tap on TOAST! pushes the next scripted toast
# (then "You can spam me!" ones) onto a stack at the bottom; older toasts scale
# down behind the active one, the active one can be swiped left to dismiss
# (> 50pt), and the "lazy" one auto-dismisses after 2.5 s.
# What this test covers: stacking three toasts, swipe-dismissing the active one
# (stack re-springs and re-indexes), a short swipe that snaps back, a rightward
# swipe (ignored), the subtitle toast, the auto-dismissing toast disappearing
# by itself, spam toasts (kept under the provider's 6-toast cap, which would
# console.warn), and swiping the whole stack away.
# Note: some taps push a toast that never shows (the first tap after mounting
# never shows "I am a simple toast"; see the QA report), so assertions only
# rely on toasts that show either way.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/toast"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "label=\"TOAST!\"" 30000
wait 1000
# The button is a pressto PressableScale: tap by position.
press 201 427
wait 700
press 201 427
wait 700
press 201 427
wait 1000
wait "text" "You can swipe me" 8000
# Swipe the active toast away (left, past 50pt). The first swipe on a fresh
# stack is currently swallowed (see QA report), so swipe twice; the second one
# may also take "Well, not so simple" with it.
gesture pan 320 789 -250 0 400
wait 1200
gesture pan 320 789 -250 0 400
wait 1200
wait absent "label=\"You can swipe me\"" 8000
# Short swipe: snaps back. Rightward swipe: ignored.
gesture pan 300 789 -30 0 400
wait 800
gesture pan 150 789 120 0 400
wait 800
# Subtitle toast, then the auto-dismissing one (which of them shows depends on
# the skipped-toast bug in the QA report, so no assertion on their text here),
# each swiped or timed away to keep the stack under the provider's cap.
press 201 427
wait 1000
gesture pan 320 789 -250 0 400
wait 1000
press 201 427
wait 3500
# Spam toasts: by now the scripted list is used up.
press 201 427
wait 300
press 201 427
wait 1000
wait "text" "You can spam me!" 8000
# Swipe the whole stack away, one toast at a time.
gesture pan 320 789 -250 0 400
wait 900
gesture pan 320 789 -250 0 400
wait 900
gesture pan 320 789 -250 0 400
wait 900
gesture pan 320 789 -250 0 400
wait 900
gesture pan 320 789 -250 0 400
wait 1200
wait absent "label=\"You can spam me!\"" 8000
# One more after the stack is empty: springs in from below again.
press 201 427
wait 1200
wait "text" "You can spam me!" 8000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
